{"start":"t:body","attrs":{}}
{"text":"\n      "}
{"start":"t:div","attrs":{"corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:poem:yigdal","facs":"https://archive.org/download/mahzor-lyom-rishon-shel-rosh-hashanah-day-one-jenny-marmorstein-1965/page/n42.jpg"}}
{"text":"\n        "}
{"start":"t:note","attrs":{"type":"description","{http://www.w3.org/XML/1998/namespace}lang":"en"}}
{"text":"The Thirteen Principles"}
{"end":"t:note"}
{"tail":"\n        "}
{"start":"t:p","attrs":{}}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"stanza","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:poem:yigdal_daniel/1"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"Exalted is the living God and praised. He exists and timeless is His existence. "}
{"end":"t:p"}
{"tail":"\n        "}
{"start":"t:p","attrs":{}}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"stanza","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:poem:yigdal_daniel/2"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"He is unique and there is nought unique like His uniqueness. He is hidden and infinite too is His unity. "}
{"end":"t:p"}
{"tail":"\n        "}
{"start":"t:p","attrs":{}}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"stanza","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:poem:yigdal_daniel/3"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"He has not the shape of a body nor is He a body. We cannot estimate His sanctity. "}
{"end":"t:p"}
{"tail":"\n        "}
{"start":"t:p","attrs":{}}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"stanza","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:poem:yigdal_daniel/4"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"He was there before anything that was created; He is the first and there was no beginning to His beginning. "}
{"end":"t:p"}
{"tail":"\n        "}
{"start":"t:p","attrs":{}}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"stanza","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:poem:yigdal_daniel/5"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"Behold He is the Master of the world and every creature indicates His grandeur and His rule. "}
{"end":"t:p"}
{"tail":"\n        "}
{"start":"t:p","attrs":{}}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"stanza","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:poem:yigdal_daniel/6"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"The wealth of His prophecy did He bestow upon men of His possession and His glory. "}
{"end":"t:p"}
{"tail":"\n        "}
{"start":"t:p","attrs":{}}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"stanza","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:poem:yigdal_daniel/7"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"No other prophet arose in Israel like Moses, who perceived His likeness. "}
{"end":"t:p"}
{"tail":"\n        "}
{"start":"t:p","attrs":{}}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"stanza","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:poem:yigdal_daniel/8"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"The true Torah has God given to His people through His prophet, the faithful one of His house. "}
{"end":"t:p"}
{"tail":"\n        "}
{"start":"t:p","attrs":{}}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"stanza","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:poem:yigdal_daniel/9"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"God will not alter nor will He change His law for another unto eternity. "}
{"end":"t:p"}
{"tail":"\n        "}
{"start":"t:p","attrs":{}}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"stanza","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:poem:yigdal_daniel/10"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"He observes and knows our secrets, perceiving even at its beginning the end of a matter. "}
{"end":"t:p"}
{"tail":"\n        "}
{"start":"t:p","attrs":{}}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"stanza","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:poem:yigdal_daniel/11"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"He treats man kindly according to his conduct and sends disaster to the wicked according to his wickedness. "}
{"end":"t:p"}
{"tail":"\n        "}
{"start":"t:p","attrs":{}}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"stanza","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:poem:yigdal_daniel/12"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"He will send our Messiah at the end of days to redeem those who wait for the finality of His salvation. "}
{"end":"t:p"}
{"tail":"\n        "}
{"start":"t:p","attrs":{}}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"stanza","corresp":"urn:x-opensiddur:text:poem:yigdal_daniel/13"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"tail":"God will revive the dead in the abundance of His grace. Blessed for ever and ever be His renowned Name. "}
{"start":"t:milestone","attrs":{"unit":"stanza"}}
{"end":"t:milestone"}
{"end":"t:p"}
{"tail":"\n      "}
{"end":"t:div"}
{"tail":"\n    "}
{"end":"t:body"}
